The files ChatLog.rexx and SysChatLog.rexx will not be needed anymore.... 
so kill it from your PFiles dir and Remove the lines from your BBStext....

Then copy the log.L10Cxxxx files from your Sysdata dir to Sysdata:log/ and remove 
the log. in the front of every log file.... I.e. Sysdata:log.L10C is now 
Sysdata:log/L10C !

Then copy the included files of this archiv over the old ones !!

Then reload Cnet and take a look at the tool. After the normal last 10 callers
screen, the user will be asked if he want to see the last 10 uploaded 
or downloaded files... just try it ! but make sure that the log files 
Uloads and Dloads are in your sysdata:log/ dir !

I removed the Chat log shit... therefor i put in some new stuff.. like how long
was the user on and i did some cosmetical fixes... now i think, its prefect...
